# Summary
- **CLI and core logic:** MIT License (open source, permissive)
- **RulePacks, advanced middleware, commercial add-ons:** Proprietary, commercial use requires a separate license

This open-core model allows free and open use of the CLI and core, while reserving advanced/commercial features for future licensing and protection.
